  "html": "<h1 id=\"user-content-install\">Install</h1>\n<p>Install the tools in three steps. Start with the <a href=\"#\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-zfolio-slug=\"welcome\">Welcome</a> page, then read <a href=\"#\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-zfolio-slug=\"tuning\" data-zfolio-heading=\"user-content-limits\">Tuning#Limits</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-steps\">Steps</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the package.</li>\n<li>Run <code>setup</code>.</li>\n<li>Check the version.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://zfolio-images.zuuid.cc/i/ryvb4aqbbsHireHWlPQfxxqDHQJo6YkVYhE9imKt0b8.png\" alt=\"The setup screen\"></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setup</span> --check\n</code></pre>\n<p><math display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></p>",
